      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Edwin Wolters Memorial Museum and Welhausen Park honor founding families, with the park still hosting picnics, baseball games, and town events.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
